  },
  "slides": {
    "slide_0": {
      "group": "Verse 1",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Still, still with Thee, when purple morning breaketh,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "When the bird waketh, and the shadows flee;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Fairer than morning, lovelier than daylight,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Dawns the sweet consciousness, I am with Thee.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_1": {
      "group": "Verse 2",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Alone with Thee, amid the mystic shadows,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "The solemn hush of nature newly born;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Alone with Thee in breathless adoration,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "In the calm dew and freshness of the morn.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_2": {
      "group": "Verse 3",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Still, still with Thee! As to each newborn morning",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "A fresh and solemn splendor still is given,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "So does this blessed consciousness, awaking,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Breathe each day nearness unto Thee and heaven.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_3": {
      "group": "Verse 4",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "So shall it be at last, in that bright morning,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "When the soul waketh and life's shadows flee;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "O in that hour, fairer than daylight dawning,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Shall rise the glorious thought, I am with Thee.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
